              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लपेटणो — lapeṭṇo — \"to wrap\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मां रोटी कपड़ा मांय लपेटै है। mā̃ roṭī kapṛā mā̃y lapeṭai hai. Mother wraps the flatbread in a cloth."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): म्हैं रोटी लपेटी, mhaĩ roṭī lapeṭī."
            }
