          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लपेटणो (lapeṭṇo) is inherited from a reconstructed lappēṭṭ, \"wrap\". CDIAL gives no Marwari form in this entry, but lists Hindi lapeṭnā, \"to wrap, fold, wind\" (CDIAL 10942)."
